-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Scope / Geltungsbereich
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT licence above covers only the project's own code and assets:
*.html, *.js, *.css, tools/*.py, launcher scripts and the generic vehicle
models in models/*.glb.

Data files are NOT covered by the MIT licence and remain under their
original licences (Datenlizenzen):

- data/buildings.bin, data/buildings.json
    3D-Gebäudemodell HE LoD2, Datenquelle: Hessische Verwaltung für
    Bodenmanagement und Geoinformation (HVBG),
    Datenlizenz Deutschland – Namensnennung – Version 2.0
    https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/by-2-0  (modified: triangulated, clipped)
- data/terrain.bin, data/terrain.json, data/height.bin, data/hillshade.jpg
    DGM1 Hessen, HVBG, Datenlizenz Deutschland – Zero – Version 2.0
    https://www.govdata.de/dl-de/zero-2-0
- data/dop.jpg
    DOP20 Hessen, HVBG, Datenlizenz Deutschland – Zero – Version 2.0
- data/trees.bin, data/trees.json
    Baumkataster Stadt Frankfurt am Main, Grünflächenamt
    (offenedaten.frankfurt.de), Datenlizenz Deutschland – Namensnennung – 2.0
    (modified: clipped, converted)
- data/streets.bin, data/streets.json, data/furniture.json
    © OpenStreetMap contributors. Derived database, made available under the
    Open Database License (ODbL) 1.0: https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/
    Generated street lamps are schematic additions.
- data/gtfs_riedberg.json
    Schedule data generated by gtfs.de (data: DELFI e.V.), CC BY 4.0
    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/ (modified: clipped)
- textures/*
    ambientCG (https://ambientcg.com), CC0 1.0 – see textures/LIZENZ.txt

Runtime services (not redistributed here): Transitous (transitous.org/sources),
gtfs.de GTFS-RT (CC BY-SA 4.0, local proxy only), Bright Sky / DWD,
Open-Meteo (CC BY 4.0), HVBG DOP20 WMS, three.js via jsDelivr (MIT).
